  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes an image of a man shouting 'we want sharia law!!' with an image of a woman saying 'then go the fuck home.' The intent is to express hostility and rejection toward the idea of Sharia law, using inflammatory language and a dismissive, aggressive tone. This reflects a hateful attitude toward individuals or communities associated with Sharia law, portraying them as unwelcome or undesirable in a Western context. The meme promotes intolerance and fear of Islamic legal systems, aligning with Islamophobic tropes by equating Sharia law with backwardness or threat to Western values. The use of vulgar language and the dismissive gesture further amplify the hostile intent.",
